faqs:
  - q: "What is AEO?"
    a: "AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) is the practice of optimizing your content to be cited by AI-powered search tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot. Unlike traditional SEO that focuses on ranking in search results, AEO focuses on being the answer that AI models cite when users ask questions."
  - q: "Is AEO replacing SEO?"
    a: "No, AEO complements SEO. Traditional search engines like Google are not going away, but AI-powered answer engines are capturing a growing share of search traffic. By 2026, over 40% of product and service searches begin with AI tools. The smartest strategy is optimizing for both — which is exactly what we do."
  - q: "How quickly does AEO work?"
    a: "AEO results can appear faster than traditional SEO because AI models update their knowledge continuously. Depending on your industry and existing authority, you may see your first AI citations within 4-8 weeks. Building consistent citation volume takes 3-6 months of structured optimization."
  - q: "How do you measure AEO results?"
    a: "We track AI citations across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot. We monitor brand mentions, direct citations, and recommendation frequency. We also measure downstream traffic from AI-referred visitors and conversion rates from those channels."
  - q: "What does AEO cost?"
    a: "AEO services start at $2,500/month and include our full 7-layer framework implementation, monthly citation tracking, and ongoing content optimization. We offer combined SEO + AEO packages that provide better ROI than implementing each separately."
  - q: "Can any business benefit from AEO?"
    a: "Most businesses can benefit, but AEO is especially powerful for service businesses, B2B companies, consultants, healthcare providers, and local businesses where trust and authority matter. If customers research before buying, AEO gives you a massive competitive advantage."
