<!-- Intro Section -->
<section class="intro-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Shift</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">Search Has Fundamentally Changed</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">People are not just Googling anymore. They are asking ChatGPT for product recommendations. They are using Perplexity to research service providers. They are relying on Google AI Overviews to make buying decisions.</p>
    <div class="intro-copy fade-in">
      <p>Traditional SEO optimizes your site to rank in search engine results pages. Answer Engine Optimization optimizes your content to be <strong>cited as the answer</strong> by AI-powered tools.</p>
      <p>This is not a future trend. It is happening now. Over 40% of product and service searches in 2026 start with AI tools instead of traditional search engines. If your business is not optimized for answer engines, you are invisible to a massive — and rapidly growing — segment of your potential customers.</p>
      <p>GullStack is one of the only agencies building full-service AEO strategies. We do not just optimize for Google. We optimize for the entire search landscape — including the AI-powered tools your customers are already using to make decisions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7-Layer Framework -->
<section class="framework-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">Our Process</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">The 7-Layer AEO Framework</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">We have reverse-engineered how AI models decide which sources to cite. Here is the exact system we use to get our clients mentioned first.</p>
    <div class="framework-grid">
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <span class="framework-number">1</span>
        <h3>Structured Data Architecture</h3>
        <p>AI models rely on schema markup to parse content. We implement Organization, LocalBusiness, Service, FAQPage, and HowTo schema so AI tools can accurately understand and cite your business.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <h3>E-E-A-T Signal Building</h3>
        <p>Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, Trustworthiness. We build author credentials, case studies, client testimonials, and third-party validation that prove your business is a legitimate authority.</p>
        <span class="framework-number">2</span>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <span class="framework-number">3</span>
        <h3>Definitive Answer Content</h3>
        <p>AI models cite sources that provide clear, factual, well-structured answers. We rewrite your service pages and blog content in a format optimized for AI citation — not just human readers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <h3>Citation-Worthy Brand Facts</h3>
        <p>We create machine-readable brand fact files, process documentation, and authoritative data sets that AI models can confidently cite when users ask about your industry.</p>
        <span class="framework-number">4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <span class="framework-number">5</span>
        <h3>Multi-Platform Distribution</h3>
        <p>Getting cited requires visibility. We distribute your optimized content across platforms AI models crawl — industry directories, forums, knowledge bases, and authoritative third-party sites.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <h3>Continuous Citation Monitoring</h3>
        <p>We track mentions across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot. Monthly reports show citation volume, sentiment, and competitive position in AI-generated answers.</p>
        <span class="framework-number">6</span>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-card fade-in">
        <span class="framework-number">7</span>
        <h3>Iterative Optimization</h3>
        <p>AEO is not set-it-and-forget-it. AI models update continuously. We refine content, test new citation triggers, and adapt strategies based on what drives the most AI mentions for your business.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AEO vs SEO Comparison -->
<section class="comparison-section">
  <div class="container">
